# Generated lookup datasets: ~35MB of JSON per language package. They are
# produced by a generator, never hand-edited, and formatting them adds minutes
# to every `lint:pre` run (the `src/**/*.json` glob would otherwise match them).
src/lang/data/**/location-name-map-data/

# A language's translated manual: written block for block against the English
# page (`docs/manual-sources/`, which is not formatted either), and hashed by
# `manualI18n.mjs`. A reflowed page would stop lining up with its English.
src/lang/data/**/manual/

# Written by `extra-work/fix-cross-ref-titles.mjs` in its own JSON layout.
src/lang/data/**/cross-ref-title-fixes*.json
